{% comment %}
  APEX hidden dedication page (Figma "APEX Hidden Dedication Page"): James's letter to L & H,
  reached from the LH mark in the footer. Centred LH mark, eyebrow, Dharma title, the letter and
  a "Love always, Dad" sign-off. The letter comes from the page's own content in admin; the
  Letter setting is only used when that is empty.
{% endcomment %}
<div class="apex-dedication-page">
  <div class="apex-container apex-dedication-page__inner">
    <div class="apex-dedication-page__mark" aria-hidden="true">{{ 'apex-dedication-mark.svg' | inline_asset_content }}</div>
    {%- if section.settings.eyebrow != blank -%}
      <p class="apex-eyebrow apex-dedication-page__eyebrow">{{ section.settings.eyebrow | escape }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}
    <h1 class="apex-dedication-page__title">{{ section.settings.title | escape }}</h1>
    <div class="apex-dedication-page__letter">
      {%- if page.content != blank -%}
        {{ page.content }}
      {%- else -%}
        {{ section.settings.letter }}
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
    <p class="apex-dedication-page__signoff">{{ section.settings.signoff | escape }}</p>
    <p class="apex-dedication-page__name">{{ section.settings.name | escape }}</p>
  </div>
</div>

{% stylesheet %}
  /* Figma: mark 48px under the header, title 820 wide, letter about 600 wide, centred */
  .apex-dedication-page {
    padding-block: 48px 128px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .apex-dedication-page__inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .apex-dedication-page__mark {
    display: flex;
    width: 58px;
    height: 40px;
    color: var(--apex-sandstone);
  }

  .apex-dedication-page__mark svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .apex-dedication-page__eyebrow {
    margin: 24px 0 0;
  }

  .apex-dedication-page__title {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 24px 0 0;
    font-family: var(--font-heading--family);
    font-weight: var(--font-heading--weight);
    font-size: clamp(2.75rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
    line-height: 1;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--apex-burrow);
  }

  .apex-dedication-page__letter {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin-block-start: 40px;
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--apex-burrow);
  }

  .apex-dedication-page__letter p {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
  }

  .apex-dedication-page__letter > :last-child {
    margin-block-end: 0;
  }

  .apex-dedication-page__signoff {
    margin: 48px 0 0;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--apex-burrow);
  }

  .apex-dedication-page__name {
    margin: 4px 0 0;
    font-family: var(--font-heading--family);
    font-weight: var(--font-heading--weight);
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--apex-burrow);
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .apex-dedication-page {
      padding-block: 40px 96px;
    }

    .apex-dedication-page__letter {
      font-size: 0.9375rem;
    }
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "APEX dedication",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "apex-dedication-section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "eyebrow",
      "label": "Eyebrow",
      "default": "For L & H"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "title",
      "label": "Title",
      "default": "To the only two reasons that kept me going"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "letter",
      "label": "Letter",
      "default": "<p>If you’ve found this, then you found the only page on this website that was never meant for customers. It was always meant for you.</p><p>If there is one thing I hope life teaches you, it’s that your dreams are worth chasing, no matter how impossible they may seem at the beginning.</p><p>You don’t need to be the smartest person in the room, you don’t need to have the most money, you don’t need the perfect plan. You just simply need to begin!</p><p>There will be people who doubt you, moments where you doubt yourself, and days when giving up feels easier than taking another step forward, but never give up.</p><p>Some of the greatest things in life are built one small step at a time, and along the way, you will fail, you will make mistakes, you will try things that don’t work, you will put your heart and soul into something and watch it fall apart.</p><p>That’s not the end of your story; it’s only the beginning. Every failure is a lesson, every setback is a chance to grow, every mistake is something that teaches you how to do it better next time.</p><p>Don’t be afraid of failing, be afraid of never trying. Learn from everything, work the problem, adjust and take another step and keep going!</p><p>Believe in yourself before anyone else does, work hard when nobody is watching, treat people with kindness, stand by your word, never stop learning and never let fear decide what your future looks like.</p><p>Success isn’t measured by what you own or what people think of you, it’s measured by the person you become while chasing something you truly believe in.</p><p>Whatever path you choose, I don’t care if you’re building a business, raising a family, creating art, helping others, or following a dream that nobody else understands. Give it everything you’ve got.</p><p>If this little company ever becomes something you’re proud of, I hope it reminds you that every big achievement begins with someone willing to believe in an idea before anyone else could see it.</p><p>Most of all, I hope you always believe in yourselves. Because I always will.</p>",
      "info": "Only shown when the page's own content in Online Store > Pages is empty."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "signoff",
      "label": "Sign-off",
      "default": "Love always,"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "name",
      "label": "Name",
      "default": "Dad"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "APEX dedication"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
